# Charge-me Not — Project Rules

## Language
- 100% Kotlin

## UI Framework
- Jetpack Compose with Material 3 (No XML layouts)

## Architecture
- Clean Architecture with MVVM and StateFlow

## Local Persistence
- Room Database

## Strict Privacy
- Local-first only, no cloud databases or external APIs.

## Code Style
- Production-ready only. No placeholder functions.
- Keep ViewModels free of Android framework imports.
